# ===== The Veil: the Doubles' Mirror spells deal half of her own spell (spec D17, 2026-10-07) =====
# Her Sigil of Malice and Ethereal Chains deal 1d6 per slot level. A Double casts the variant for her highest slot,
# halved: N = 3 at levels 5-6, 4 at 7-8, 5 at 9-10, 6 at 11+. ARCANA_Deceiver_Doubles.txt (kit step) gives the one for
# her level. The suffix is _SlotN, not _N, so gen_upcast_variants.pl never takes them for card variants.

@file Spell_Projectile
@section -

new entry "Projectile_Deceiver_Double_MirrorSigil_Slot3"
type "SpellData"
data "SpellType" "Projectile"
using "Projectile_Deceiver_Double_MirrorSigil"
data "SpellProperties" "DealDamage((3d6)/2,Force,Magical);ApplyStatus(SIGIL_TECH,100,0);"
data "DescriptionParams" "DealDamage((3d6)/2,Force)"
data "TooltipDamageList" "DealDamage((3d6)/2,Force)"

